'''Earthshaking Fist''' is the only stage in '''Oddity in the Desert II''', which appears after clearing [[Burning Sands Area 10]]. It drops no items, but unlocks stages 11-16 of [[Ashvini Desert]] when cleared. It was added in [[Version 12.1 Update|Version 12.1]]. This is a [[No Continues]] stage.

